<section id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center">
      <h2 class="rise">Everything a reel needs, already in.</h2>
      <p class="lead rise">No plug-ins to hunt for. No template shop.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card rise">
        <div><h3>The pauses are gone before you look</h3><p>The app finds the silences and cuts there. What's left sits on the timeline as pieces you can drag, trim or delete.</p>
